Calm your senses and open your eyes.

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,400
I know you have what it takes to do this.

8
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,920
Now look at your immediate
surroundings and peer into the future.

9
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,449
I'd like to hear the song,

10
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:43,580
I'd like to hear the song,
I'd like to hear the song,

11
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:49,917
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:57,000
sorry,

13
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:09,100
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

14
00:01:41,740 --> 00:01:43,497
The end of the day is the end of the day.

15
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:45,109
When the world is falling,

16
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,420
I will never die,

17
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:50,410
Hell no!

18
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,700
The beginning of the world!

19
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,400
Ah, birds!

20
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:17,960
The birds flew by just like I saw!

21
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:27,470
Ah!

22
00:02:27,553 --> 00:02:29,320
Boss, I think I found something.

23
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:31,857
It was hard for me, but Eulogy found him.

24
00:02:31,940 --> 00:02:33,175
Ten seconds from now.

25
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,360
I can't believe it.

26
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:38,197
The guy's blending into the
cliffs to stay out of sight.

27
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,160
But I can't see him right now.

28
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:43,497
My bare eyes are useless as
long as he stays like this.

29
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:44,500
That's Risotto.

30
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:47,620
Somehow he's also able
to disguise himself.

31
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:53,700
Of course he's normally invisible, but
you saw him because of your foresight.

32
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:58,124
Topio, look a few seconds ahead
and see how he's going to attack.

33
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,600
There he is!

34
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:02,240
He's on the move!

35
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,660
What the hell?!

36
00:03:11,340 --> 00:03:13,280
I've got some bad news, boss!

37
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:17,557
In 10 seconds, scissors are going
to rip their way out of my throat!

38
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,860
Peace, Stopio.

39
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:22,280
Despite appearances,
that was not your death.

40
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:26,078
Risotto is the one defector
who's eluded the familia.

41
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:28,820
Dealing with him will result in injury.

42
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:32,157
You must use those seconds
of knowledge granted to you

43
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:35,299
by your foresight and deduce
how he will attack you.

44
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,240
Will do, boss.

45
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:39,277
He's definitely moving in for the kill.

46
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:41,597
So there's no way he's
using a long-range stand.

47
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:44,797
And so if my vision from
the future is showing

48
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:47,197
a pair of scissors being
lodged in my throat,

49
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:51,980
does that mean there's nothing I can
do to change my destiny, boss? Exactly.

50
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:53,817
You've seen the inevitable.

51
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,547
Now you must prepare for it.

52
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:59,832
There is no denying scissors
will sprout from your throat.

53
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,380
But see beyond that.

54
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:06,380
Discover the method behind his madness,
and his weakness is yours to exploit.

55
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:13,020
Once you do, move within two meters and
destroy him with Emperor Crimson's arm.

56
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,740
Damn it all!

57
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:17,680
There you are, die!

58
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:20,450
Rookie.

59
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:22,800
Then again,

60
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,780
in all my years as a hitman,

61
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:28,417
no one has ever been able to get
as close to yours truly as you.

62
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:29,997
Well done for a fledgling.

63
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:33,180
I'm curious, how did you know where I was?

64
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,760
Your abilities are so unusual.

65
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:39,560
Regardless, you must still die.

66
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,480
Ah, damn it.

67
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:48,037
How'd he manage to get them under my skin?

68
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:52,880
He hasn't so much as laid a finger
on me, and I'd never open my mouth.

69
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,037
I don't even remember catching
a glimpse of his stand.

70
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,885
But these scissors are
opening up on their own.

71
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:02,829
If I don't act fast, he'll cut
something vital in my throat.

72
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:04,592
I've got to get him out!

73
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:13,377
Those movements...

74
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:16,040
I was on track to bisect his trachea.

75
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:18,737
But from the way he put
his hands to his throat,

76
00:05:18,820 --> 00:05:22,408
he's acting as if he anticipated
the scissors would be there.

77
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,860
He knows something.

78
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:25,340
Better be careful.

79
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:28,420
My next strike needs
to put an end to this.

80
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:31,400
Eat shit, Katsune!

81
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:40,980
Damn it.

82
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,580
How does he do it?

83
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,940
The boss is gonna lose his shit.

84
00:05:45,620 --> 00:05:48,091
How the hell does this guy just disappear?

85
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:51,520
Regardless, he really got me good.

86
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:53,680
I'm getting wobbly.

87
00:05:57,040 --> 00:06:02,480
wait that's what's wrong dopio were
you able to see risotto's attack

88
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:08,277
sorry boss i'm here did
you see it or didn't

89
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:11,617
you your silence tells me you need to move

90
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:14,417
provoke him into giving
chase and pinpoint his

91
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:18,200
location don't fail me
you bastard I'm scared!

92
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,647
I'm ready for what may come.

93
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:26,549
I swear he won't be
able to trick me again.

94
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:30,820
Keikatsu, I'll get in range
if it's the last thing I do.

95
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:36,777
Emperor Crimson has provided you
with yet another vision, hasn't it?

96
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:37,900
What did you see?

97
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,920
I'm asking you a question, Dopio!

98
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,160
What did you see?

99
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:50,897
my foot boss i know
what he's gonna do next

100
00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:54,437
and it's he's gonna go after my right foot

101
